{
  "note": "Seed for Brand.settings.planner of Neckermann Strom (German power company, residential + commercial, Europe/Berlin). Built 2026-11-06 from the tags on its 93 ready assets (evergreen/year-round and winter-months, window Nov 15-Mar 30). Own assets only for now; the planned 80% Neckermann / 20% SolarMeister split needs a cross-brand pool change (planner-v2-db.mjs loads assets by brandId) and is a separate PR. Settings only: posts per day per network are set on Review (0 = skipped). All copy is German (language de). Posts 7 days a week, 08:00-20:00 Berlin with 70% between 10:00 and 16:00. Load by hand with: {\"action\":\"configure-planner-brand\",\"brandSlug\":\"neckermann-strom\",\"settings\":<settings>,\"accounts\":[]}",
